Fatty Liver Diet Plan: Kya Khayein Aur Kin Cheezon Se Parhez Karein (Complete Guide)
​Fatty liver aajkal ek aam samasya ban chuki hai, jo mukhya roop se galat khaan-paan, excessive sugar, refined oils aur kam physical activity ki wajah se hoti hai. Jab liver cells mein extra fat jama ho jata hai, toh liver ka natural function slow hone lagta hai.
​Achi baat yeh hai ki Grade 1 aur Grade 2 Fatty Liver ko sahi santulit aahar (diet) aur rozaana ki routine se poori tarah reverse kiya ja sakta hai.
​Neeche diya gaya aahar niyam aapke liver ko detox karne aur charbi ko pighlane mein madad karega.
​Fatty Liver Mein Kya Khayein (Best Foods for Liver)
​Hari Pattedar Sabziyan:
​Palak, methi, sarson, aur lauki mein powerful antioxidants aur chlorophyll hote hain, jo liver cells par jami charbi ko kam karne mein madad karte hain.
​Sabut Anaaj (Complex Carbs):
​Maida aur white rice ki jagah jowar, bajra, ragi, daliya aur oats chunein. Inme high soluble fiber hota hai jo blood sugar ko control karke liver par fat store hone se rokkta hai.
​Healthy Fats (Omega-3 Rich Foods):
​Alsi ke beej (flax seeds), chia seeds, aur akhrot (walnuts) ko apni diet ka hissa banayein. Yeh liver inflammation (sujan) ko kam karte hain.
​Kachhi Haldi Aur Lahsun:
​Lahsun mein allicin aur selenium hota hai jo liver enzymes ko activate karta hai.
​Haldi mein maujood curcumin liver tissue ko damage hone se bachata hai.
​Chhaas (Buttermilk) Aur Nimbu Paani:
​Din mein bina namak ya thoda bhuna jeera daal kar chhaas piyein. Yeh digestion ko theek rakhta hai aur liver par fat metabolize karne ka load kam karta hai.
​In Cheezon Se Bilkul Parhez Karein (Foods to Avoid)
​Refined Sugar Aur Sweet Drinks: Cold drinks, packaged juice, sweets aur chai mein cheeni liver fat ka sabse bada kaaran hain.
​Deep Fried Food: Samose, pakode, bhujia aur fast food mein trans-fats hote hain jo liver damage ko badhaate hain.
​Refined Vegetable Oils: Palm oil ya bar-bar garam kiye gaye tel ka upyog band karein. Khana banane ke liye sarson ka tel (mustard oil) ya olive oil limited quantity mein use karein.
​Alcohol: Fatty liver detect hone par sharab ka sevan poori tarah band kar dena zaroori hai.
